Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:09:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pos): group the invoice share actions under one Share
 menu (E-18)

Print stays its own button; Download PDF and Open in WhatsApp move into one
Share dropdown, matching the Desk (DEC-97 amendment). The menu is shown only
for a submitted, server-side invoice, as before.
